nked work involves read the litmus log; compare teacher reference liquids; inspect r-26 ph entries; identify missing tests and draft a referral note. The mapping is provisional until career-domain review.', 'Preferred', 'B.Sc. Microbiology; B.Sc. Chemistry; B.Sc. Environmental Science', 'ICS', '{"verbal_reasoning": 74, "logical_reasoning": 83, "numerical_reasoning": 75, "data_interpretation": 88, "pattern_recognition": 72, "spatial_reasoning": 52}'::jsonb, '{"openness": 4, "conscientiousness": 5, "extraversion": 2, "agreeableness": 3, "emotional_stability": 4}'::jsonb, '{"impact": 5, "status": 3, "autonomy": 3, "security": 4, "financial": 3, "lifestyle": 3, "creativity": 3, "leadership": 2}'::jsonb, '{"areas": ["Data Interpretation", "Logical Reasoning", "Verbal Reasoning"], "rationale": "These are suggested role-demand areas for Water Health Researcher, based on read the litmus log; compare teacher reference liquids; inspect r-26 ph entries; identify missing tests and draft a referral note. They require subject-matter review before assessment matching."}'::jsonb, '{"traits": ["Conscientiousness", "Openness", "Agreeableness"], "rationale": "These traits may support the work of Water Health Researcher, especially keep sample ids matched to observations; compare indicator readings; flag missing microbial tests and sample history before any safety statement. This is a role hypothesis, not an assessment of a learner."}'::jsonb, '{"values": ["Impact", "Security", "Autonomy"], "rationale": "This exploratory pathway may appeal to learners who value impact, security, autonomy. Individual interest must come from the learner''s assessment, not the course."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET "role_family_domain_id"=EXCLUDED."role_family_domain_id", "role_id"=EXCLUDED."role_id", "description"=EXCLUDED."description", "observable_behaviours"=EXCLUDED."observable_behaviours", "role_work_context"=EXCLUDED."role_work_context", "typical_work_activities"=EXCLUDED."typical_work_a